  "worked_solution": "The only two numbers that are at a distance of $5$ from zero are $-5$ and $5.$ So, $5$ is the additive inverse of $-5.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152428/assets/2d418c843ba95e0714b1f744f25ba9b1eb767bf570c2026f7f3bc45bf692cb5b.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152428/assets/da584206c645e659efb4a1945fd98fe79189136bfdf1dafefe78d2f03dddb3b5.png)",
