thML\"><mn>5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the additive inverse of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>5.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-68908-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-68908-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-68908-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-68908-e-1\"></div></div>",
